  "text": "## Red Flags During Customer Interaction  \n**Be Alert If Customer:**\n- Seems coached or nervous\n- Can't explain purpose of transaction\n- Uses unusual channels or amounts\n- Third party is present and controlling conversation\n- Requests cash immediately after deposit  \n**Be Alert If Teller Colleague:**\n- Bypasses controls\n- Works unusual hours alone\n- Has access they shouldn't have\n- Makes undocumented exceptions",
